ChimpMaera synthetic CPU video package reference

The PNG and WAV fixtures in assets/synthetic are generated entirely from fixed
constants by scripts/generate-synthetic-assets.mjs and are intended for
redistributable conformance testing.

The .cmvideo output is canonical synthetic package-index JSON. It is not a
playable video or media container. This reference provides no production
renderer, codec, Docker/container hardening, GPU, TTS, model, network,
publication, deployment, production-media, external-artifact-equivalence, or
NVENC-byte-identity claim.
